  "_about": "SA-1099 A-3 note 3 (WP5). ONE decision, two runtimes: 'would buying this SKU add nothing for this workspace'. apps/api/src/billing/noop-addon-cases.parity.spec.ts runs every case through skuAddsSomething over the REAL resolver + courtesy functions; apps/api/scripts/report-noop-addons.mjs --self-test runs every case through classifyRow. Both must give `expected`. `why` is the reason per granted flag: plan (the plan carries it), courtesy (a dark flag on a plan that is not always enforced, switch off), override (an active GRANT). A DENY removes any reason. A rule changed on one side only turns the other side's suite red.",
